<div class="page-head"><div class="titles"><h1>Annual stocktakes</h1><p>Organize your count teams, freeze the selected stock locations, review differences and record final sign-off.</p></div></div>
<% if(locked){ %><p class="notice"><span class="badge">Growth</span> Annual stocktake work requires Growth or above. Retained results stay readable. <a class="btn" href="/settings/billing">Upgrade</a></p><% } %>
<p>Growth approves each prepared plan. Pro and Custom can prepare an exact requested plan without training. The owner separately confirms the freeze, every stock adjustment and final sign-off. Counters physically check the goods using blind count lists.</p>
<p>This workflow covers up to 10,000 recorded whole-unit stock positions in up to 50 locations, including bins. Tracked and measured goods, unexpected products with no recorded stock position and broad automatic annual scheduling require separate work. A freeze blocks StockChief stock movements, stock value changes and stock commitments at the selected locations until sign-off or an explicit stop. Arrange any pause in external marketplace sales separately.</p>
<% if(problem){ %><p class="notice"><%= problem %></p><% } %>
<% if(selected){ const p=selected; %>
<section class="card section"><h2><%= p.title %> · <%= p.stocktake_year %></h2><p><strong><%= p.status==='SIGNED_OFF'?'Signed off':p.status==='FROZEN'?'Stock locations frozen':p.status==='STOPPED'?'Stopped — freeze released':'Plan ready for review' %></strong></p>
<p><%= p.scope.positions.toLocaleString() %> recorded stock positions. Freeze scope: <%= p.scope.locations.map(l=>l.name).join(', ') %>.</p>
<% if(p.status==='DRAFT'&&!locked){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= p.id %>/freeze" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="planHash" value="<%= p.plan_hash %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I confirm these exact locations and count teams. Freeze their stock activity and open the physical count lists.</label><button class="btn" <%= problem?'disabled':'' %>>Freeze these locations and start counting</button></form><% } %>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Count location</th><th>Counter</th><th>Positions</th><th>Physical counts recorded</th><th>Worksheet</th></tr></thead><tbody><% teams.forEach(t=>{ %><tr><td><%= t.location_name %></td><td><%= t.counter_name %></td><td><%= t.planned_positions %></td><td><%= t.observed %></td><td><%= t.status||'Ready when frozen' %><% if(t.campaign_id&&!locked){ %> · <a href="/warehouse/counts/campaigns/<%= t.campaign_id %>">Review worksheet</a><% } %></td></tr><% }); %></tbody></table></div>
<% if(p.status==='FROZEN'&&!locked){ %><p>Counters find their blind count lists in Needs you. The owner reviews completed counts on each worksheet before approving any differences. An empty location with no recorded stock positions has no count worksheet; check unexpected goods separately.</p>
<% teams.filter(t=>t.status==='DRAFT'&&Number(t.observed)<Number(t.planned_positions)).forEach(t=>{ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= p.id %>/reassign" class="form-stack card"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="locationId" value="<%= t.location_id %>"><label>Remaining counts at <%= t.location_name %><select name="counterId" required><% people.forEach(u=>{ %><option value="<%= u.id %>" <%= u.id===t.counter_id?'selected':'' %>><%= u.name %></option><% }); %></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Assign the remaining positions. Earlier counts keep their original counter.</label><button class="btn" <%= problem?'disabled':'' %>>Reassign remaining counts</button></form><% }); %>
<% } %>
<% if(totals&&p.status!=='DRAFT'){ %><p><strong><%= totals.applied %> of <%= totals.positions %> positions applied</strong> · <%= totals.uncounted %> need counts · <%= totals.differences %> differences.</p><p>Reviewed stock value change: <%= currency&&Number.isSafeInteger(Number(totals.value_difference))?helpers.money(Number(totals.value_difference),currency):'Review each worksheet for its exact value change' %>.</p><% } %>
<% if(p.status==='FROZEN'&&!locked){teams.filter(t=>t.status==='REVIEW_REQUIRED').forEach(t=>{ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= p.id %>/recheck" class="form-stack card"><h3>Recheck <%= t.location_name %></h3><p><%= t.problem||'This worksheet needs owner review.' %></p><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="locationId" value="<%= t.location_id %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="physicallyRechecked" value="yes" required> I physically rechecked the remaining recorded counts.</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Reopen this worksheet for individual review. Completed adjustments stay posted.</label><button class="btn" <%= problem?'disabled':'' %>>Reopen these rechecked counts</button></form><% });} %>
<% if(p.status==='FROZEN'&&!locked&&teams.every(t=>t.status==='COMPLETED')){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= p.id %>/signoff" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="reviewHash" value="<%= reviewHash %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I reviewed these completed physical counts and stock value changes. Sign off this stocktake and release the freeze.</label><button class="btn" <%= problem?'disabled':'' %>>Sign off and release the freeze</button></form><% } %>
<% if(['DRAFT','FROZEN'].includes(p.status)){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= p.id %>/stop" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Stop this stocktake and release its freeze. Completed adjustments remain posted; remaining count work stops.</label><button class="btn">Stop stocktake and release freeze</button></form><% } %>
<% if(p.signed_off_at){ %><p>Signed off <%= helpers.dateTime(p.signed_off_at) %>.</p><% } %>
</section>
<% }else if(!locked){ %><section class="card section"><h2>Prepare a count plan</h2><form method="post" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="requestKey" value="<%= requestKey %>"><label>Stocktake name<input name="title" value="Annual stocktake" maxlength="160" required></label><label>Year<input type="number" name="year" value="<%= year %>" min="2000" max="2200" required></label><fieldset><legend>Stock locations to include</legend><p>Choosing a warehouse includes its existing bins.</p><% locations.forEach(l=>{ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="locationIds" value="<%= l.id %>"> <%= l.name %></label><% }); %></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Count team</legend><p>Recorded positions are shared among your selected counters within their existing warehouse access.</p><% people.forEach(u=>{ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="counterIds" value="<%= u.id %>"> <%= u.name %></label><% }); %></fieldset><button class="btn" <%= problem?'disabled':'' %>>Prepare this stocktake plan</button></form></section><% } %>
<section class="card section"><h2><%= filterStatus==='FROZEN'?'Your frozen stocktakes':'Your stocktakes' %></h2><form method="get" action="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes"><label>Show stocktakes<select name="status"><option value="">All plans</option value="DRAFT" <%= filterStatus==='DRAFT'?'selected':'' %>>Ready for review</option><option value="FROZEN" <%= filterStatus==='FROZEN'?'selected':'' %>>Frozen</option><option value="SIGNED_OFF" <%= filterStatus==='SIGNED_OFF'?'selected':'' %>>Signed off</option><option value="STOPPED" <%= filterStatus==='STOPPED'?'selected':'' %>>Stopped</option></select></label><button class="btn">Show these stocktakes</button></form><% if(!rows.length){ %><p>No stocktake plans yet.</p><% } %><% rows.forEach(r=>{ %><p><a href="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes/<%= r.id %>"><%= r.title %> · <%= r.stocktake_year %></a> · <%= r.status %></p><% }); %><% if(page>1){ %><a href="?page=<%= page-1 %>&amp;status=<%= filterStatus||'' %>">Previous page</a><% } %><% if(more){ %><a href="?page=<%= page+1 %>&amp;status=<%= filterStatus||'' %>">Next page</a><% } %><% if(selected&&!locked){ %><p><a href="/autopilot/annual-stocktakes">Plan another stocktake</a></p><% } %></section>
<p>AI credits used: 0. Plans use your recorded stock and team permissions.</p>
